 {"steamid": "76561198001079869", "personaname": "Vorschreibung", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/farcube/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 4919, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2014, "last_played": 1780656883, "avatar": "ce9da5f4322f4ddd9edc1cb25307f4e617118336"}, "language": "english", "review": "Everything you want in an Alien game, good mechanics and content make for an interesting progression. Highly recommended.", "timestamp_created": 1637543659, "timestamp_updated": 1637543659, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.529411792755126953", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103239060", "author": {"steamid": "76561198174735827", "personaname": "Mikienidas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198174735827/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 3045, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2331, "last_played": 1709956730, "avatar": "1228a3b866bcfc493edec2d0ed53b8b89ebfd0dc"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the most fun and legit Alien game out there. Even if you aren't a fan of Alien it is still a really fun game.", "timestamp_created": 1637532864, "timestamp_updated": 1637532864, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.529411792755126953", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103234734", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088391765", "personaname": "Fireforce Doggo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198088391765/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 5198, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3160, "last_played": 1680927127, "avatar": "4f2b135eb85399e496aa3963dac5aa4e2914592e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Despite a small player base and some badly missing features (no team chat? At this point in video games, at this time or year, in this part of the country?) the game is a lot of fun. It's not earth shattering in terms of innovation other than the fact that it's an Aliens video game that someone actually gave a ♥♥♥♥ about.\n\nIf you're looking for a perfectly polished, triple A experience like the ones that Triple A companies used to make, or you're not a big Aliens fan, then you could find a better third person, mission based shooter out there, I'm sure. For Aliens fans, however, despite it's blemishes there's lots of good jokes, movie-based decals, weapons, and so on. They've tried to tread the line of nostalgia and innovations (unfortunately acknowledging that things like Prometheus exist in the process) and are largely successful.\n\nThe devs has been pretty responsive, so I'm hoping they'll add a team chat, 4 player support (I mean, a fireteam isn't 3 people in the real world US military or in the movies, so the 3 player choice seems odd), more actual bug hunt missions without synths thrown in, some bug fixes, and better AI teammates.", "timestamp_created": 1637527487, "timestamp_updated": 1637527487, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103209280", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035048202", "personaname": "HunterXXI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198035048202/", "num_games_owned": 689, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 910, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 815, "last_played": 1731692127, "avatar": "25c98d92ef106c76a08c20ce86ce611959542fe1"}, "language": "english", "review": "forces you to do entire campaign before u can do any horde mode which basic killed off the game no servers so u have to  guess which difficulty players are on to join if any are on at all an in cases you get a game the best kitted player just run ahead to leave u to die it's 3 player which tad strange as they could done 1 more for a decent squad an the maps well it's all passage ways an tunnels the entire maps built this way !!!common least could of made more enviroments which could bin more unique it's run gun an check ur ass or bunker up.", "timestamp_created": 1637500940, "timestamp_updated": 1637500940, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47413790225982666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}